OL,3,GNEWSATown centre hosts festive sleigh
OL,4,Ahunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA free Christmas trail featuring 10
OL,7,Fdecorated sleighs has launched in
OL,8,FStaines-upon-Thames.
OL,10,FThe sleighs have been placed at
OL,11,Flocations across the town centre as
OL,12,Fpart of a festive attraction organised
OL,13,Fby Visit Staines.
OL,15,FThey said visitors can climb aboard the
OL,16,F"uniquely designed sleighs" and take
OL,17,Fpictures.
OL,19,FEach also contains a hidden letter
OL,20,Fwhich makes up a word as part of a
OL,21,Ffestive puzzle, organisers added.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
